export anchor DesktopNativeStyle:
    number: 214
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Desktop native
    idea: A generic desktop application window, with a title bar, a toolbar of small push buttons, a grey source list on the left and a zebra striped table view, so the dashboard feels installed rather than visited.
    base: light
    palette:
        desktop: #dde1e7, the backdrop behind the floating window
        chrome: #f5f5f6, the title bar, toolbar, table column heads and status bar
        sourceList: #e9eaed, the grey sidebar
        pane: #ffffff, the content pane, group boxes and the style sheet
        zebra: #f4f5f7, every second table row
        grid: #e2e4e8, lines between every cell and around group boxes
        text: #1c1e22, labels and values
        secondary: #595d65, meta, column heads, counts and chart labels
        selection: #2456c4, the selected sidebar row, push button, sidebar icons and this week bars
        focusRing: #4b7fe2, the 3px keyboard ring
        onTrack: #1d7436, On track text with a circle and tick
        atRisk: #885500, At risk text with a triangle and bang
        behind: #b02a20, Behind text and overdue figures with an octagon and cross
    type:
        One system stack, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI,
        system-ui, Cantarell, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif.
        Base text is 13px at 1.45. The page title is 20px semibold, KPI
        values 22px semibold with tabular figures, the toolbar title 14px
        semibold, column heads 12px semibold grey, sidebar group headings
        11px bold grey and the status bar 11px.
    layout:
        The page is a grey desktop with one window centred on it, at most
        1232px wide with a 24px margin. A 30px title bar holds a small
        app mark and the name Brightwork on the left, the word Home in the
        centre and minimise, maximise and close glyph buttons on the
        right. Below it a toolbar holds a sidebar toggle, a joined back
        and forward pair, the bold title Home, then on the right a 240px
        search field, a blue New project push button, a bell with a red
        dot and the avatar with the name Mara Okafor. The body is a 216px
        grey source list beside a white pane. The source list has a
        Brightwork heading over the six nav rows with blue line icons, Home
        filled blue with white text and a count of 6 on Projects, then an
        Active projects heading listing the six projects with their
        percent as a grey count. The pane opens with the greeting and a
        line giving the date and a red 4 tasks are overdue. Next comes a
        single bordered inspector strip of four cells split by hairlines,
        each with a small icon label, a value and a note. Then a Projects
        heading with 6 items and 78 of 170 tasks done, over a bordered
        table with lines between all cells and zebra rows, sorted by due
        date, with columns for name, team, a thin level bar with percent,
        tasks as 18 / 25, due with days left, and status. Below sit two
        group boxes side by side, the bar chart on the left slightly wider
        and activity on the right with initials avatars and times on the
        far right. A status bar closes the window with counts and the date.
        Below 860px the window loses its margin and corners, the sidebar
        becomes a scrolling row of nav items, the search moves to its own
        toolbar row, the strip becomes two by two, the table scrolls
        inside its box and the group boxes stack.
    spacing: A 4px grid. Table rows are 26px, toolbar controls 28px, and the pane has 16 by 20px padding with 16px between blocks.
    density: Compact like a utility app. All six projects, the chart and the activity fit one 1280 by 800 screen.
    corners: 10px on the window, 6px on buttons, fields, the strip, table and group boxes, 5px on the sidebar selection.
    borders: 1px #d2d4d8 under the title bar and toolbar and beside the sidebar. 1px #e2e4e8 between every table cell and around boxes.
    shadows: Only the window floats, with a 1px dark ring, 0 18px 48px at 22 percent and 0 2px 6px. Everything inside is flat.
    icons:
        16px rounded line icons at stroke 1.7, blue in the sidebar and grey
        in the toolbar. Status uses a circle with a tick, a triangle with a
        bang and an octagon with a cross, always beside the coloured word.
    focus: A 3px #4b7fe2 outline offset 1px on every control and field. A focused table row is filled blue with white text plus the ring.
    tone: Terse system labels such as Name, Team, Due, 6 items and Latest first, with one warm greeting.
